<title>USA: GREG MANNING SAYS AFINSA BIENES PURCHASES SHARES. [CORRECTED 19:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>GREG MANNING SAYS AFINSA BIENES PURCHASES SHARES. [CORRECTED 19:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WEST CALDWELL, N.J. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greg Manning Auctions Inc said Tuesday Afinsa Bienes Tangibles SA of Madrid, Spain, purchased (corrects from &quot;plans to purchase&quot;) 6.6 percent of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>It said Afinsa's stated purpose for the purchase of the shares is solely for investment reasons.</p>
<p>The company said Afinsa has been a valued client of Greg Manning for a number of years.</p>
<p>Greg Manning Auctions is a specialty stamp auction house.</p>
</text>
